@startuml
hide circle
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam classBorderColor black
skinparam classBackgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageBorderColor #A0A0A0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam noteBackgroundColor white
skinparam noteBorderColor black
skinparam nodesep 105
skinparam ranksep 75
skinparam dpi 150
title 历史自关联类图
class "预约就诊" as A
A "0..1" -right- "0..*" A : 原预约 / 候选后继
class "诊疗项目记录" as I
I "0..1" -right- "0..1" I : 原项目 / 更正后继
class "结算单" as F
F "0..1" -right- "0..*" F : 原单 / 候选更正单
class "复诊计划" as H
H "0..1" -right- "0..1" H : 原计划 / 更正后继
class "联系与提醒记录" as M
M "0..1" -right- "0..1" M : 原尝试 / 重试后继
class "主治交接记录" as XA
XA "0..1" -right- "0..1" XA : 前任 / 后任
class "接诊补记" as XV
XV "0..1" -right- "0..1" XV : 原补记 / 更正后继
A -[hidden]right- I
I -[hidden]right- F
A -[hidden]down- H
H -[hidden]right- M
M -[hidden]right- XA
H -[hidden]down- XV
legend bottom
原记录端0..1：每条记录至多有一个前驱。
后继端0..*：允许候选分支；成功改约和有效结算后继分别至多一个。
后继端0..1：链不分叉。所有链均禁止自指和循环。
endlegend
@enduml
